                        "username": "Vijaysankarr"
                    },
                    "message": "How is intentional predefined group deletion works?\nSuppose the admin deliberately removes the ipmi group because they want to restrict all users from using the IPMI interface for communication - this fix will silently recreate it on every restart, making it impossible to permanently disable a predefined group without modifying the code itself."
                },
